design to be done by the firm that did the Saigon Floating Hotel. I think they
would be more successful condo-ing that or a new hotel than explicitly creating
an independant community, but I like knowing there are other "crazy" dreamers
out there. If anyone has any other sources of information on autonomous
communities, secessions, etc ( I already have "HOW TO START YOUR OWN COUNTRY")
I'd like to hear from you. I know these attempts are generally doomed from the 
beginning but I admire them for trying.

 * Apparently not the same as Spencer McCullum's (sp?) Atlantis Project from
some decades ago. This one involves Mike Oliver, who has also tried related
schemes before.                              
